  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Hacia una Economia Verde: Apoyo al Plan de Descarbonizacion de Costa Rica</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards a Green Economy: Support for Costa Ricas Decarbonization Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del proyecto es contribuir a la progresiva transicin del pas haciacero emisiones netas de Gases Efecto Invernadero (GEI) al 2050, beneficiando a toda la poblacin a travs de reformaspara: (i) el fortalecimiento de la gestin y monitoreo de la accin climtica en CR; (ii) la conservacin y restauracin deecosistemas de alta captacin de GEI y la sustitucin de prcticas agropecuarias emisoras por fijadoras de GEI; y (iii) laincentivacin del uso de la energa elctrica. Bajo estos subsectores se apoyarn las reformas de poltica necesarias parala implementacin del Plan Nacional de Descarbonizacin (PD).La presente operacin de prstamo es la primera de una serie de dos operaciones consecutivas de un solo desembolso,independientes contractualmente, pero vinculadas tcnicamente, bajo la modalidad de prstamo Programtico Basado enPolticas (PBP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s general objective is to support the country&apos;s progressive transition to net zerogreenhouse gas (GHG) emissions by 2050, benefiting the entire population, through reforms to: (i) strengthen management andmonitoring of climate action in Costa Rica; (ii) conserve and restore ecosystems with high rates of GHG sequestration andreplace GHG-emitting agricultural practices with GHG-sequestering ones; and (iii) incentivize the use of electric power. Thenecessary policy reforms to implement the National Decarbonization Plan will be supported under these subsectors.This is the first loan in a series of two consecutive single-tranche operations that are technically related to one another butcontractually independent and financed as programmatic policy-based loans.</narrative>
  </description>
